<h2>{{FromHousehold}} would like to link households</h2>
<p>Hi {{UserName}},</p>
<p>{{InvitedByName}} from {{FromHousehold}} would like to link their household with yours on Famick Home Management.</p>
<p>Linked households see each other's people in their contacts, and each household keeps its own people's details up to date. Either household can unlink at any time.</p>
<a href="{{AcceptLink}}" class="button" style="display:inline-block;padding:14px 28px;background-color:#518751;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:4px;margin:20px 0;font-size:15px;">Review the Request</a>
<p>This link expires in {{ExpiresInDays}} days. You'll be asked to sign in.</p>
<p>If you weren't expecting this, you can ignore this email. Nothing changes unless you accept.</p>
<div class="footer" style="margin-top:30px;font-size:12px;color:#666666;">
    <p>If the button doesn't work, copy and paste this link into your browser:</p>
    <p>{{AcceptLink}}</p>
</div>
